  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of Trainers Ecosystem for Entrepreneurs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a follow-up of the Shiraka Training Programme (STP) training &apos;Ecosystem for Entrepreneurs&apos;, facilitated by the Hague Academy for Local Governance in 2022.During the closing event, the twelve participants of the programme indicated that the training content should be further shared within the Algerian entrepreneurial sector, with the purpose to reach more synergy, alignment, and cooperation between the different stakeholders in the Algerian ecosystem for entrepreneurs. Therefore, a Training-of-Trainers project was initiated.The main (indirect) purpose of this new project is to expand the established network of like-minded people working on improving the Algerian Ecosystem for entrepreneurs. This can be realized by focusing on the direct purpose of training the participants of the &apos;Ecosystem for Entrepreneurs&apos; programme in how to train others, so they can further share their gained knowledge with other actors in the Algerian Entrepreneur Ecosystem and by expanding the established network by hosting a closing event at the Netherlands embassy in Algiers, Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
